"(:mod:`ABQflow.core.inp_include`). ``include_staging='reference'`` (the "
"default) points the deck at the absolute paths of *static* includes, so a"
" shared mesh is never copied per job. Parameterized includes have no such"
" choice — their content exists nowhere on disk, so they are always "
"written into the job directory."
