"machine even when the backend is remote — "
":class:`~ABQflow.DatExtractionStrategy` fetches the ``.dat`` home first, "
"nothing is uploaded, artifact paths are not remapped, and sidecar CSVs "
"are written straight into the local job directory.  Set "
"``ABQFLOW_HOST_PYTHON`` to override the interpreter when "
"``sys.executable`` is a frozen or embedded binary."
